{"path":"keyword/double","title":"C++ keyword: double","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>double</code>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/double","section":"keyword","kind":"index","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Standard_floating-point_types\"><code>double</code> type</a>: as the declaration of the type\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Standard_floating-point_types\"><code>long double</code> type</a>: as the declaration of the type when combined with <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/long\"><code>long</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types\">Fundamental types</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/void\"><code>void</code></a><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx11\"><span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/nullptr_t\">std::nullptr_t</a></span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></span></span>.\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Integral_types\">Integral types</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/int\"><code>int</code></a>. <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Modifiers\">Modifiers</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/signed\"><code>signed</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/unsigned\"><code>unsigned</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/short\"><code>short</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/long\"><code>long</code></a>.\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Boolean_type\">Boolean type</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/bool\"><code>bool</code></a>. <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/bool_literal\">Boolean literals</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/false\"><code>false</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/true\"><code>true</code></a>.\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Character_types\">Character types</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/char\"><code>char</code></a><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx20\"><span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/char8_t\"><code>char8_t</code></a></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></span></span><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx11\"><span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/char16_t\"><code>char16_t</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/char32_t\"><code>char32_t</code></a></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></span></span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/wchar_t\"><code>wchar_t</code></a>.\n</li></ul>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types#Floating-point_types\">Floating-point types</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/float\"><code>float</code></a>, <strong class=\"selflink\"><code>double</code></strong>.\n</li></ul>\n</li></ul>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"keyword","title":"C++ keywords"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ keyword: double","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"double"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":57,"codeBlockCount":0}
